WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 2.6 · Theory of Change
Activities

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Activities are the specific actions that produce your outputs.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start each activity with a verb.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Link every activity to an output, or drop it.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Add preparation, permissions and follow-up you might forget.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Recruit trainees with the municipality, sign paid contracts, train on the job, mentor weekly, follow up at 3 and 12 months.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your activities, the output each supports and who.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
